// Windows application icon, embedded into jplay2.exe.
//
// Resource id 1 is the lowest icon id, so it becomes the default icon used by
// Explorer, the taskbar, and Alt-Tab. SDL3 (with no SDL_HINT_WINDOWS_INTRESOURCE_ICON
// hint set) also enumerates RT_GROUP_ICON and picks this first icon for the
// window class, so the running window gets it too. One resource covers all cases.
//
// The path is injected by CMake's configure_file so rc.exe finds the icon
// regardless of its working directory.
1 ICON "@JPLAY_ICON_PATH@"
